spans.s:
(-आ √ 5. इ) P. -ऐति (pr. p. -एयान, MBh.), to come together, approach together, meet at or in (acc. or loc.) or with (instr. with or without समम्), go to or across, arrive at (acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to unite with (instr.) in marriage, R.;
to enter, Hit.;
to emulate, cope with (acc.), R.;
 (with योगम्) to lead or join together, form an alliance between (gen.) and (instr.), ŚvetUp. (= सं-गमय्य, Śaṃk.)
